<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Employer Profile Debrief — Gulf View Consulting</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --navy:   #1A2E4A;
    --navy2:  #0F1E30;
    --gold:   #C9922B;
    --lgold:  #E8C97A;
    --white:  #FFFFFF;
    --lbg:    #F2F5F9;
    --card:   #FFFFFF;
    --muted:  #64748B;
    --border: #D0DCE8;
    --red:    #C0392B;
    --lred:   #FDEDEC;
    --lblue:  #A8C4E0;
  }

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
background: var(–lbg);
color: var(–navy);
overflow-x: hidden;
}

/* ── HERO ────────────────────────────────── */
.hero {
background: var(–navy2);
color: var(–white);
padding: 72px 48px 60px;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::before {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
width: 6px;
background: var(–gold);
}
.hero::after {
content: ‘★’;
position: absolute;
right: 48px; top: 50%;
transform: translateY(-50%);
font-size: 160px;
color: rgba(201,146,43,0.08);
line-height: 1;
pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-eyebrow {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 0.2em;
color: var(–lgold);
text-transform: uppercase;
margin-bottom: 20px;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.5s 0.1s forwards;
}
.hero h1 {
font-family: ‘Bebas Neue’, sans-serif;
font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 88px);
line-height: 1;
letter-spacing: 0.02em;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.5s 0.2s forwards;
}
.hero h1 span { color: var(–gold); }
.hero-sub {
margin-top: 20px;
font-size: 15px;
color: var(–lblue);
font-weight: 300;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.5s 0.3s forwards;
}
.hero-tags {
display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
margin-top: 32px;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.5s 0.4s forwards;
}
.hero-tag {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.12em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–navy);
background: var(–gold);
padding: 5px 14px;
border-radius: 2px;
font-weight: 500;
}

/* ── LAYOUT ──────────────────────────────── */
.container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
.section { padding: 64px 0 48px; }

/* ── SECTION HEADER ──────────────────────── */
.section-header {
display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px;
margin-bottom: 36px;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.5s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
}
.section-header.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.section-num {
font-family: ‘Bebas Neue’, sans-serif;
font-size: 13px;
letter-spacing: 0.18em;
color: var(–gold);
background: var(–navy);
padding: 6px 12px;
white-space: nowrap;
margin-top: 4px;
flex-shrink: 0;
}
.section-titles h2 {
font-family: ‘Bebas Neue’, sans-serif;
font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
letter-spacing: 0.03em;
line-height: 1.1;
color: var(–navy);
}
.section-titles p {
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–muted);
font-style: italic;
margin-top: 4px;
}

/* ── SNAPSHOT GRID ───────────────────────── */
.snapshot-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
gap: 12px;
}
.snap-card {
background: var(–card);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-top: 4px solid var(–gold);
padding: 18px 20px 16px;
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.4s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}
.snap-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.snap-card.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.snap-label {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9.5px;
letter-spacing: 0.14em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–gold);
font-weight: 500;
margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.snap-value {
font-size: 15px;
font-weight: 600;
color: var(–navy);
line-height: 1.4;
}

/* ── STRATEGY CARDS ──────────────────────── */
.strategy-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(460px, 1fr));
gap: 16px;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) { .strategy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.strat-card {
background: var(–card);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-top: 4px solid var(–gold);
display: flex; gap: 0;
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
overflow: hidden;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.4s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}
.strat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.strat-card.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.strat-num {
background: var(–navy);
color: var(–gold);
font-family: ‘Bebas Neue’, sans-serif;
font-size: 28px;
width: 52px;
min-width: 52px;
display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.strat-body { padding: 18px 20px; }
.strat-body h3 {
font-size: 14px;
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–navy);
margin-bottom: 8px;
line-height: 1.3;
}
.strat-body p {
font-size: 12.5px;
color: var(–muted);
line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ── CONCERNS ────────────────────────────── */
.concerns-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(460px, 1fr));
gap: 16px;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) { .concerns-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.concern-card {
background: var(–card);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-top: 4px solid var(–red);
padding: 20px 22px;
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.4s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
transition: transform 0.2s;
}
.concern-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
.concern-card.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.concern-title {
display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;
font-size: 13.5px;
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–red);
margin-bottom: 10px;
line-height: 1.4;
}
.concern-title .warn { font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
.concern-risk {
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–muted);
font-style: italic;
line-height: 1.6;
margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.fix-row {
display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
}
.fix-badge {
background: var(–gold);
color: var(–navy);
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
font-weight: 500;
letter-spacing: 0.1em;
padding: 4px 8px;
flex-shrink: 0;
margin-top: 2px;
}
.fix-text {
font-size: 12.5px;
color: var(–navy);
line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ── QUESTIONS ───────────────────────────── */
.q-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 16px;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) { .q-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.q-col {
background: var(–card);
border: 1px solid var(–border);
border-top: 4px solid var(–gold);
padding: 24px 24px 20px;
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.4s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
}
.q-col.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.q-col-head {
display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
margin-bottom: 20px;
padding-bottom: 14px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–border);
}
.q-col-head .icon {
background: var(–navy);
color: var(–gold);
width: 32px; height: 32px;
border-radius: 50%;
display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
font-size: 14px;
flex-shrink: 0;
}
.q-col-head h3 {
font-size: 15px;
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–navy);
}
.q-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.q-list li {
display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
font-size: 12.5px;
color: var(–muted);
line-height: 1.6;
}
.q-list li::before {
content: ‘›’;
color: var(–gold);
font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 700;
flex-shrink: 0;
margin-top: -1px;
}

/* ── BOTTOM LINE ─────────────────────────── */
.bottom-line {
background: var(–navy2);
color: var(–white);
padding: 64px 48px 56px;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
margin-top: 48px;
}
.bottom-line::before {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
height: 4px;
background: var(–gold);
}
.bottom-line::after {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
height: 4px;
background: var(–gold);
}
.bottom-line h2 {
font-family: ‘Bebas Neue’, sans-serif;
font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
letter-spacing: 0.04em;
color: var(–white);
margin-bottom: 36px;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.5s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
}
.bottom-line h2.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.bl-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; max-width: 860px; }
.bl-item {
display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;
opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.4s forwards;
animation-play-state: paused;
}
.bl-item.visible { animation-play-state: running; }
.bl-icon {
font-size: 18px;
flex-shrink: 0;
margin-top: 1px;
}
.bl-icon.check { color: var(–gold); }
.bl-icon.warn  { color: var(–lgold); }
.bl-text {
font-size: 15px;
color: var(–white);
line-height: 1.65;
font-weight: 300;
}
.bl-text strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(–lgold); }

/* ── FOOTER ──────────────────────────────── */
.footer {
background: var(–navy2);
color: var(–lblue);
text-align: center;
padding: 20px 32px;
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.1em;
text-transform: uppercase;
border-top: 1px solid rgba(168,196,224,0.15);
}

/* ── ANIMATIONS ──────────────────────────── */
@keyframes fadeUp {
from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* ── DIVIDER ─────────────────────────────── */
.divider {
height: 1px;
background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(–border), transparent);
margin: 0;
}

/* delay helpers */
.d1 { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
.d2 { animation-delay: 0.12s; }
.d3 { animation-delay: 0.19s; }
.d4 { animation-delay: 0.26s; }
.d5 { animation-delay: 0.33s; }
.d6 { animation-delay: 0.40s; }
</style>

</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══ HERO ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Gulf View Consulting &nbsp;·&nbsp; VETS Training Exercise</p>
    <h1>Employer Profile<br><span>Group Debrief</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">New Light Manufacturing Company &nbsp;·&nbsp; Industrial / Supervisory Hiring</p>
    <div class="hero-tags">
      <span class="hero-tag">Strategy</span>
      <span class="hero-tag">Concerns</span>
      <span class="hero-tag">Questions to Ask</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ SNAPSHOT ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="section" style="background: var(--lbg);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">Background</span>
      <div class="section-titles">
        <h2>Employer Snapshot</h2>
        <p>What we know going in</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="snapshot-grid">
      <div class="snap-card d1"><div class="snap-label">Industry</div><div class="snap-value">New light manufacturing company</div></div>
      <div class="snap-card d2"><div class="snap-label">Current Size</div><div class="snap-value">~8 core employees</div></div>
      <div class="snap-card d3"><div class="snap-label">Veterans Wanted</div><div class="snap-value">2 veteran hires</div></div>
      <div class="snap-card d4"><div class="snap-label">Timeline</div><div class="snap-value">Hiring within 6 months — wants quick turnaround</div></div>
      <div class="snap-card d5"><div class="snap-label">Existing Orders</div><div class="snap-value">2 years of orders already secured</div></div>
      <div class="snap-card d6"><div class="snap-label">Vet Experience</div><div class="snap-value">Owner has <em>never</em> worked with veterans before</div></div>
      <div class="snap-card d1"><div class="snap-label">Roles</div><div class="snap-value">Industrial / supervisory — technical skills required</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══ STRATEGY ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="section" style="background: var(--white);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">Question 1</span>
      <div class="section-titles">
        <h2>Initial Strategy &amp; Approach</h2>
        <p>How we plan to engage this employer from day one</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="strategy-grid">
      <div class="strat-card d1">
        <div class="strat-num">01</div>
        <div class="strat-body">
          <h3>Target the Right Veteran Profile</h3>
          <p>Focus on senior NCOs (E-6 to E-7) with industrial or operations backgrounds. This employer needs proven supervisors — not entry-level candidates. Pre-screen through internal DVOP/LVER networks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="strat-card d2">
        <div class="strat-num">02</div>
        <div class="strat-body">
          <h3>Host a Targeted Hiring Event</h3>
          <p>Use the job center to organize a veteran-specific hiring event. Post on Facebook, create a flyer, and leverage MO Jobs portal. Coordinate logistics including an HR rep on-site.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="strat-card d3">
        <div class="strat-num">03</div>
        <div class="strat-body">
          <h3>Educate the Employer on Military Rank &amp; KSAs</h3>
          <p>Owner is new to hiring veterans. Walk them through the rank structure, translate military experience into civilian terms, and reinforce the built-in KSAs veterans bring — leadership, discipline, adaptability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="strat-card d4">
        <div class="strat-num">04</div>
        <div class="strat-body">
          <h3>Do Market Research First</h3>
          <p>It's a new company. Review labor market data, investor backing, and industry projections before pitching veterans on the role. We need to be able to say "this is a solid opportunity" with confidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══ CONCERNS ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="section" style="background: var(--lbg);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">Question 2</span>
      <div class="section-titles">
        <h2>Concerns &amp; How We'll Address Them</h2>
        <p>Red flags and how we're thinking about handling them</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="concerns-grid">

```
  <div class="concern-card d1">
    <div class="concern-title"><span class="warn">⚠</span> Company Stability — It's brand new</div>
    <p class="concern-risk">How do we tell a veteran this is a solid long-term opportunity if the company hasn't proven itself yet?</p>
    <div class="fix-row">
      <span class="fix-badge">FIX</span>
      <p class="fix-text">Lead with the 2 years of secured orders. Pull LMI data to show the sector's growth trajectory. Frame it as a ground-floor opportunity with supervisor-level upside.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="concern-card d2">
    <div class="concern-title"><span class="warn">⚠</span> Employer Doesn't Understand Military Experience</div>
    <p class="concern-risk">Owner may not recognize the value of rank, MOS, or military KSAs on a resume — or may undervalue them.</p>
    <div class="fix-row">
      <span class="fix-badge">FIX</span>
      <p class="fix-text">Proactively educate before the first candidate is sent. Translate rank into civilian equivalents. Show how an E-7 maps to a floor supervisor or operations lead.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="concern-card d3">
    <div class="concern-title"><span class="warn">⚠</span> Resume Translation for the Veteran</div>
    <p class="concern-risk">Veterans sometimes write resumes in military language — acronyms, rank titles, mission language — that civilian employers can't parse.</p>
    <div class="fix-row">
      <span class="fix-badge">FIX</span>
      <p class="fix-text">Run resumes through a civilian translation process before submission. Use tools (ChatGPT, resume builders) to convert MOS experience into industry-relevant language.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="concern-card d4">
    <div class="concern-title"><span class="warn">⚠</span> Very High Skill Bar</div>
    <p class="concern-risk">Employer wants someone with strong industrial AND leadership skills — a narrow target population.</p>
    <div class="fix-row">
      <span class="fix-badge">FIX</span>
      <p class="fix-text">Be upfront about the difficulty of the match. Use all available networks — DVOP/LVER caseloads, job fairs, MO Jobs, Facebook — to cast a wide but targeted net.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
```

  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══ QUESTIONS ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="section" style="background: var(--white);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">Question 3</span>
      <div class="section-titles">
        <h2>What We Still Need to Learn</h2>
        <p>Questions to ask the employer + research to do before our next conversation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q-grid">

```
  <div class="q-col d1">
    <div class="q-col-head">
      <div class="icon">🤝</div>
      <h3>Ask the Employer</h3>
    </div>
    <ul class="q-list">
      <li>What are your 5–10 year growth projections?</li>
      <li>What does the full compensation package look like — base pay, medical, dental, retirement?</li>
      <li>Are you able to accommodate VA medical appointment leave?</li>
      <li>What does a typical week look like for this role — travel, shifts, overtime?</li>
      <li>Have you worked with any staffing partners or workforce agencies before?</li>
      <li>What does success look like in the first 90 days?</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="q-col d2">
    <div class="q-col-head">
      <div class="icon">🔍</div>
      <h3>Research to Do</h3>
    </div>
    <ul class="q-list">
      <li>Pull LMI data for light manufacturing in this region — 3–5 year outlook</li>
      <li>Review investor info / business filings if available — confirm company stability</li>
      <li>Check the company's social media / website presence</li>
      <li>Review any WOTC or hiring incentive eligibility</li>
      <li>Identify veteran candidates in our caseload with industrial / supervisory background</li>
      <li>Connect with DVOP/LVER counterparts in surrounding areas for pipeline support</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>
```

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ BOTTOM LINE ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="bottom-line">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>The Bottom Line</h2>
    <div class="bl-list">
      <div class="bl-item d1">
        <span class="bl-icon check">✓</span>
        <p class="bl-text">This employer has <strong>real potential</strong> — 2 years of orders, supervisor-level roles, and strong KSA alignment with veteran talent.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bl-item d2">
        <span class="bl-icon check">✓</span>
        <p class="bl-text">Our biggest job upfront is <strong>education</strong>: translate military rank and experience into language this employer actually understands.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bl-item d3">
        <span class="bl-icon check">✓</span>
        <p class="bl-text"><strong>Target senior NCOs (E-6 to E-7)</strong> with industrial or operations backgrounds — not entry-level candidates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bl-item d4">
        <span class="bl-icon warn">△</span>
        <p class="bl-text"><strong>Company is new</strong> — confirm stability through LMI data and investor research before committing veterans to this opportunity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bl-item d5">
        <span class="bl-icon check">✓</span>
        <p class="bl-text">Use <strong>every tool available</strong>: hiring events, MO Jobs, Facebook, internal caseloads, and DVOP/LVER networks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FOOTER ════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

<footer class="footer">
  Gulf View Consulting &nbsp;·&nbsp; Employer Profile Exercise Debrief &nbsp;·&nbsp; Veterans' Employment and Training Service
</footer>

<script>
  // Intersection observer for scroll-triggered animations
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.classList.add('visible');
        observer.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.12 });

  document.querySelectorAll(
    '.section-header, .snap-card, .strat-card, .concern-card, .q-col, .bl-item, .bottom-line h2'
  ).forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
</script>

</body>
